{"title": "Cat's Grace (passive feature)", "pageid": 28267, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Cat's_Grace_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Cat's Grace</b> is a passive feature that enhances your dexterity as well as others.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You gain <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cat%27s_Grace\" title=\"Cat's Grace\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Cat%27s_Grace_Icon.webp/25px-Cat%27s_Grace_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Cat%27s_Grace_Icon.webp/38px-Cat%27s_Grace_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Cat%27s_Grace_Icon.webp/50px-Cat%27s_Grace_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Cat's Grace\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Cat%27s_Grace_Icon.webp/25px-Cat%27s_Grace_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Cat%27s_Grace_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Cat%27s_Grace\" title=\"Cat's Grace\">Cat's Grace</a> and increase your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/25px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/38px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/50px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dexterity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png/25px-Dexterity_Small_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Dexterity_Small_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a> by 2, to a maximum of 20. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Graceful_Cloth\" title=\"The Graceful Cloth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/The_Graceful_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Graceful_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/The_Graceful_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-The_Graceful_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/The_Graceful_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-The_Graceful_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/The_Graceful_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-The_Graceful_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/The_Graceful_Cloth_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/The_Graceful_Cloth\" title=\"The Graceful Cloth\">The Graceful Cloth</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The +2 Dexterity bonus from Cat's Grace does not stack with the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gloves_of_Dexterity\